    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύμβᾰχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύμβη</span> B) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>head-foremost, tumbling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκπεσε δίφρου κύμβαχος ἐν κονίῃσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.586
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐπ᾽ ὤμους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					10.30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				584.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., ὁ, <i>crown of a
			helmet</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρυθος . . ἱπποδασείης κ. ἀκρότατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.536
				</span></i>
			.</div>
